    "notes": {
        "721b5139-0168-4da6-b1bb-0e32525963b0": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1104,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Provokes its own events\n\nThe triggers subscribe account-wide webhooks when the flow starts; the Wait gives Cal.com a minute before the flow books, reschedules and cancels a booking of a hidden event type **e2e-calcom-triggers-<timestamp>**. Keep the Wait. The event type is deleted in the main chain a minute after the cancellation (the AfterAll output carries the correlation of whichever trigger arrives last, so it cannot reference the event type).\n\n- The user needs free time in the next 8 days.\n- Run it alone: other bookings made in the account meanwhile fire the triggers too."
        }
    }
